bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    cuda_interpreter_f64_compute_ops_sentinel_2026_11_26, 0, "Split from cuda_gpu_gated_spec_defects_2026-08-09 item 3. In a seed built without the cuda feature the seven interpreter shims rt_cuda_f64_{binary_op,sum,minmax,sum_axis,scalar_div,slice_1d,slice_2d} still return the -3 not-compiled-in sentinel while libcuda is present. Unlike the driver calls they cannot be routed through CudaFns: their kernels live only in the cuda-feature runtime, so a fix needs those kernels as PTX loaded through the dlopen driver (or an explicit unsupported error)."

